The business wants access to the detailed records behind the financial results, with filters such as:

Employee ID
Market and region
Operating unit or branch
Period
Possibly GL account

They do not necessarily need SQL access. They need the ability to search the same underlying information that you and Sai currently retrieve using SQL.

My recommendation is a read-only OneStream dashboard backed by a parameterized Data Adapter or Business Rule. Do not give users a free-text SQL box because it creates security and performance risks.
